  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "для",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " means 'for' and sets up the reason.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это модный формат открытой кухни.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is a trendy open kitchen format.' Now let's analyze this line: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "модный",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", meaning 'trendy', comes from the term for fashion. ",
