   "t": "Повара не должны быть на арене!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Cooks should not be in an arena!' Now we can look at the speech: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Повара",
