   "t": " means 'on the arena', as Russians use 'on' here instead of 'in'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Гости любят смотреть на процесс готовки.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Guests love watching the cooking process.' Let us focus on this line: ",
