   "t": "каждый",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " means 'every'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Зато в ресторане станет больше посетителей.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'On the other hand, there will be more patrons in the restaurant.' Now we can examine the speech: ",
